---
import Container from '@/components/Container.astro';
---

<section id="kosten" class="cost" aria-labelledby="costs-heading" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:ks3nqv">
  <svg class="spr" aria-hidden="true">
    <symbol id="a" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><circle cx="29" cy="31" r="18"/><circle cx="29" cy="31" r="11"/><path d="M17 22c7-6 18-7 25 0M17 40c7 6 18 7 25 0"/><path d="M21 18v5M37 18v5M21 39v5M37 39v5"/><circle cx="29" cy="31" r="2.7"/><circle cx="49" cy="16" r="10"/><path d="M49 11v10M44 16h10"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="b" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><circle cx="28" cy="30" r="18"/><circle cx="28" cy="30" r="11"/><path d="M16 21c7-6 18-7 25 0M16 39c7 6 18 7 25 0"/><path d="M20 17v5M36 17v5M20 38v5M36 38v5"/><circle cx="28" cy="30" r="2.7"/><circle cx="48" cy="46" r="11"/><path d="m42 46 4 4 8-9"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="c" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><circle cx="26" cy="30" r="17"/><circle cx="26" cy="30" r="10"/><path d="M15 22c6-6 16-6 22 0M15 38c6 6 16 6 22 0"/><circle cx="26" cy="30" r="2.6"/><circle cx="48" cy="20" r="11"/><path d="M53 15c-2-2-8-2-9 2-1 5 9 3 9 8-1 4-7 4-10 1M48 10v20"/><path d="M10 10l44 44"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="22"/><path d="M32 29v14"/><circle cx="32" cy="20" r="2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="ar" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M12 32h38M39 21l11 11-11 11"/></symbol>
  </svg>

  <Container>
    <div class="inner" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:sdpv0u">
      <div class="ey" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:p8db6b">KOSTEN FÜR VERMIETER</div>
      <h2 id="costs-heading" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:i4q5p4">Welche Rauchmelder-Kosten sind umlagefähig?</h2>
      <p class="sub" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:p8db6a">3 Kostenarten: auf einen Blick erklärt.</p>

      <div class="tabs" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:tabs">
        <span data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:8qolwz"><svg><use href="#a"/></svg>Ersteinbau</span>
        <span data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:8qolwy"><svg><use href="#b"/></svg>Wartung &amp; Prüfung</span>
        <span data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:8qolwx"><svg><use href="#c"/></svg>Gerätemiete</span>
      </div>

      <div class="rows" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:rows">
        <article class="r amber" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:5femmm-0">
          <div class="ico" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:sdpv10"><svg><use href="#a"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:sdpv0z">
            <h3 data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:kusgcs">Ersteinbau</h3>
            <p data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:v80jt">Die erstmalige Ausstattung einer Wohnung mit Rauchwarnmeldern wird rechtlich als Modernisierung eingeordnet. Unter den gesetzlichen Voraussetzungen kann dafür eine Mieterhöhung zulässig sein.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pill" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:sdpv0y"><i></i>Kann als Modernisierung gelten</div>
        </article>

        <article class="r green" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:5femmm-1">
          <div class="ico" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:sdpv0x"><svg><use href="#b"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:sdpv0w">
            <h3 data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:kusgcr">Wartung &amp; Prüfung</h3>
            <p data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:v80js">Laufende Kosten für Wartung und Prüfung können als Betriebskosten auf Mieter umgelegt werden, sofern das im Mietvertrag entsprechend vereinbart ist.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pill" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:sdpv0v"><i></i>Umlage grundsätzlich möglich</div>
        </article>

        <article class="r red" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:5femmm-2">
          <div class="ico" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:sdpv0u"><svg><use href="#c"/></svg></div>
          <div class="txt" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:sdpv0t">
            <h3 data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:hnoik3">Gerätemiete</h3>
            <p data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:v80jr">Reine Mietkosten für Rauchwarnmelder dürfen dagegen nicht auf Mieter umgelegt werden, wie der Bundesgerichtshof entschieden hat (BGH, Az. VIII ZR 379/20).</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pill" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:sdpv0s"><i></i>Nicht umlagefähig</div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="note" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:note">
        <svg><use href="#i"/></svg>
        <span data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:8qolww">Die genaue Umlage hängt von Maßnahme, Mietvertrag und Rechtslage ab. Diese Übersicht ersetzt keine Rechtsberatung.</span>
      </div>

      <a class="cta" href="#ersteinschaetzung" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:cta">Kostenlos anfragen<svg><use href="#ar"/></svg></a>
      <small data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CostsSection.astro:subtext">Transparent erklärt · persönlich abgestimmt</small>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>

<style>
.cost,.cost *{box-sizing:border-box}
.spr{position:absolute;width:0;height:0;overflow:hidden}
.cost{--n:#082b4d;--g:#17a94d;--a:#d18a00;--r:#e9404a;padding:50px 0 45px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 0 28%,#faf5eb 0 10%,transparent 23%),radial-gradient(circle at 100% 100%,#eff9f3 0 10%,transparent 23%),#fff;color:var(--n)}
.inner{max-width:1350px;margin:auto;text-align:center}
.ey{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:15px;color:#40566d;font-size:14px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:3px}
.ey:before,.ey:after{content:"";width:48px;height:2px;background:#c99b4e}
.cost h2{margin:18px auto 7px;font-size:clamp(30px,3.8vw,52px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-1.5px;color:#082b4d}
.sub{margin:0 0 25px;color:#617389;font-size:18px}
.tabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:13px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:25px}
.tabs span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:9px 17px;border:1px solid #dfe7ed;border-radius:99px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 7px 20px #1736500d;font-size:14px;font-weight:800}
.tabs svg{width:25px;height:25px;fill:none;stroke:#145786;stroke-width:2.4;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.rows{display:grid;gap:17px}
.r{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:112px 1fr auto;align-items:center;gap:25px;min-height:136px;padding:20px 28px;border:1px solid #e0e7ec;border-radius:20px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 15px 35px #17365010;text-align:left;overflow:hidden}
.r:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:7px}
.amber:before{background:var(--a)}
.green:before{background:var(--g)}
.red:before{background:var(--r)}
.ico{width:84px;height:84px;margin-left:11px;border-radius:24px;display:grid;place-items:center;box-shadow:inset 0 1px #fff,0 10px 23px #17365012}
.ico svg{width:53px;height:53px;fill:none;stroke-width:2.35;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.amber .ico{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fffaf0,#ffebc0)}
.amber .ico svg{stroke:#ba7800}
.green .ico{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#effbf2,#d8f3df)}
.green .ico svg{stroke:#148d41}
.red .ico{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff2f3,#ffdde1)}
.red .ico svg{stroke:#d63642}
.txt h3{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-.5px;color:#082b4d}
.txt p{max-width:720px;margin:0;color:#536981;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5}
.pill{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:99px;font-size:15px;font-weight:850;white-space:nowrap}
.pill i{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 0 5px #ffffff80}
.amber .pill{background:#fff4dd;color:#b36e00}
.amber .pill i{background:#d88b00}
.green .pill{background:#e8f8ec;color:#11873b}
.green .pill i{background:#1bab50}
.red .pill{background:#ffecef;color:#d82e39}
.red .pill i{background:#ec3e49}
.note{max-width:1050px;margin:18px auto 15px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;gap:9px;color:#576b80;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45}
.note svg{flex:0 0 22px;width:22px;height:22px;fill:none;stroke:#294e72;stroke-width:2.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;min-width:320px;padding:15px 28px;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#24ba5b,#0c9840);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:19px;font-weight:900;box-shadow:0 12px 28px #129c432b;transition:.2s}
.cta:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
.cta svg{width:27px;height:27px;fill:none;stroke:#fff;stroke-width:3;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.inner>small{display:block;margin-top:9px;color:#647589;font-size:13px}

@media(max-width:900px){
  .r{grid-template-columns:84px 1fr}
  .pill{grid-column:2;justify-self:start}
  .ico{width:68px;height:68px;margin-left:2px}
  .ico svg{width:43px;height:43px}
  .txt h3{font-size:22px}
  .txt p{font-size:15px}
}
@media(max-width:600px){
  .cost{padding:35px 0}
  .ey{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px}
  .ey:before,.ey:after{width:25px}
  .cost h2{font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-1px}
  .sub{font-size:15px}
  .tabs{gap:7px}
  .tabs span{padding:7px 11px;font-size:12px}
  .tabs svg{width:20px;height:20px}
  .r{grid-template-columns:57px 1fr;gap:13px;padding:16px 13px}
  .ico{width:53px;height:53px;border-radius:16px}
  .ico svg{width:35px;height:35px}
  .txt h3{font-size:20px}
  .txt p{font-size:14px}
  .pill{grid-column:1/-1;padding:9px 12px;font-size:13px;white-space:normal}
  .cta{width:100%;min-width:0;font-size:17px}
}
</style>
